OL,3,GNEWSAWasp spider spotted in region for
OL,4,Afirst time
OL,5,
OL,6,FA brightly coloured wasp spider has
OL,7,Freached the north-west of England for
OL,8,Fthe first time, conservationists have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe large black and yellow spider was
OL,12,Frecorded during a survey on Chester
OL,13,FZoo's estate, with a zoo spokesperson
OL,14,Fsaying this was "the first time this
OL,15,Ffascinating mimic has reached the
OL,16,Farea".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
