OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWasp spider spotted in region for
OL,4,Afirst time
OL,5,
OL,6,FWasp spiders have only previously been
OL,7,Fspotted in the south of England but zoo
OL,8,Fbosses believe this arrival, who they
OL,9,Fhave nicknamed Wendy, is a sign that
OL,10,Fclimate change was impacting UK
OL,11,Fwildlife.
OL,13,FA zoo spokesperson said: "Despite their
OL,14,Fwarning colours and size, wasp spiders
OL,15,Fpose no threat to humans."
